A circular model where each country helps another in a continuous loop:

United States 🇺🇸 → India 🇮🇳
Provides AI research, defense partnerships, and investment in Indian startups.

India 🇮🇳 → Germany 🇩🇪
Offers skilled IT professionals, AI expertise, and pharmaceutical support.

Germany 🇩🇪 → Japan 🇯🇵
Shares industrial automation, manufacturing innovations, and renewable energy technology.

Japan 🇯🇵 → South Korea 🇰🇷
Helps with semiconductor technology, robotics, and trade partnerships.

South Korea 🇰🇷 → Israel 🇮🇱
Provides electronics expertise, 5G technology, and AI-powered cybersecurity.

Israel 🇮🇱 → Canada 🇨🇦
Collaborates on cybersecurity, AI startups, and defense technology.

Canada 🇨🇦 → United Kingdom 🇬🇧
Shares advancements in AI research, healthcare, and renewable energy.

United Kingdom 🇬🇧 → France 🇫🇷
Helps with financial services, AI ethics, and space exploration.

France 🇫🇷 → China 🇨🇳
Collaborates on smart city development, climate change solutions, and luxury industries.

China 🇨🇳 → United States 🇺🇸
Provides manufacturing, rare earth materials for AI chips, and trade relations.
